INSERT INTO `candidate_findings` VALUES ('106d77b4-176a-43aa-ac8e-88082b731bd8','790c3bec-2600-4646-ba3d-4f1d6638257c','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','C++ array length determination','User shuru mein `len(nums)` function use karta hai array length ke liye, jo C++ mein raw arrays ke liye available nahi hai. Jab isko point out kiya gaya, toh usne `i<l` jaisi galat loop condition banai, jo actual array size ko consider nahi karti.',NULL,'high','[\"d775603b-3fd7-450b-895a-c8c5bf3a90b0\"]','confirmed','2026-02-03 01:57:18'),('1bcd7f66-18d7-4002-98b6-afd992e01397','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Distinguishing \'Undo Operation\' vs. \'Full Reset\'','User ne initially socha ki crash hone par sirf current operation undo hogi, jabki problem statement mein clear tha ki \'every element in the array is reset to its original value\'. Yeh distinction important hai.','\'Undo one op\' aur \'full array reset\' mein فرق samajhna bahut zaroori hai.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('2002c310-e9a2-4747-8834-235fb41e836b','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Filler Words','\'Like,\' \'uh,\' \'yeah\' jaise filler words professionalism aur seriousness kam kar dete hain, especially serious discussions mein.','Smooth flow, no \'umm... like...\'','medium','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('24112173-039d-405b-b077-3148a50fcbcb','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Confidentiality Assurance','Trust wale questions mein sirf intent nahi, explicitly mention karna ki discretion, ethics, aur protocol follow honge, even under pressure.','Trust matlab confidentiality rules follow karna.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('24b5d780-def4-4ae9-8355-dce4103e42e1','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','De-escalation Skills','Emotional situations mein student ko pehle calm down karne ka explicit mention miss ho gaya tha. Yeh first step hota hai.','Angry student? First calm down.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('3048ddb5-12b1-46f0-a122-122dab5ae9f3','252c885b-8d8d-4270-ab53-947145d8540a','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Array Rotation by Reversals','User ne `rotate` problem mein three-reversal algorithm ko successfully apply kiya. Isme pehle poora array, fir first `k` elements, fir remaining `n-k` elements reverse karna hota hai.','Array rotation ke liye 3-step reversal method yaad rakho: poora, fir first part, fir second part.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-06 16:53:57'),('38071a77-954e-4d96-b042-8e58df43922d','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Mandatory Test Mail','Har actual mail merge se pehle ek test mail khud ko bhejna absolutely mandatory hai. Isse confirm hota hai ki placeholders sahi se replace hue hain aur formatting intact hai.','Send karne se pehle, test mail zaroor bhej ke confirm kar lo.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('3d3faf93-f77d-499b-904e-bf56b7f60ac7','769dc162-aac7-4854-aefd-5c35df803b94','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Two-pointer algorithm logic','User ko two-pointer strategy mein pointers `l`, `r`, `i` ka role clear nahi hai, especially `r` ka use aur `arr[l]==arr[i]` condition jabki unique elements move karne hote hain. Loop ka starting index bhi sub-optimal tha.',NULL,'high','[\"284ed990-b392-44c1-a9a3-1ff3f533c64e\"]','deferred','2026-02-03 01:31:12'),('4e5320e4-08ae-44a0-8488-2bcec9826a52','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Google Mail Merge Placeholder Syntax','The correct merge field syntax for Google Workspace is double angle brackets (`<<Field>>`), not curly braces (`{{Field}}`). User ke draft mein yeh syntax mismatch tha.','Google merge ke liye `<<Name>>` use karo, `{{Name}}` nahi.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('4e6a23a6-e0bf-4ba8-a0c9-ee2f92fc3d12','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Batch Sending for Spam Avoidance','Spam flags se bachne aur better delivery ke liye mail merge emails ko chhote batches mein bhejna chahiye (e.g., 40-70 mails per batch) aur har batch ke beech 15-20 minutes ka gap rakhna bahut zaroori hai.','Mail merge emails ko batches mein aur gap dekar bhejo, warna spam banega.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('51c04284-ea08-4a2c-a2c3-a3916cdc5841','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Common Mail Merge Mistakes','Repeated emphasis on avoiding critical errors like leaving the Excel/Sheet open, having empty subject lines, using CC/BCC instead of merge, and incorrect placeholder syntax (`{{ }}`).','Common mistakes mat karo: Excel open, blank subject, wrong brackets.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('51d444c9-972d-4b3c-aad0-4c2ece6aef93','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Problem Statement Interpretation (\'Whenever\' keyword)','Ek complex problem mein \'whenever\' keyword ko galat interpret kiya gaya. User ne socha ki crash hone par sirf woh operation undo hoga ya saare operations end mein check honge. Problem ka matlab tha \'immediate reset\' to original array.','\'Whenever\' matlab \'turant\', end mein check nahi karna. \'Reset to original\' matlab poora array wipe out.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('5705dd88-de70-48d2-bedc-657812a16e72','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Institute Name Accuracy','Interview mein institute ka naam galat bolna can be a big red flag, like \'IIT Nairaipur\' instead of \'IIIT Naya Raipur\'.','College ka naam sahi hona chahiye, koi confusion nahi.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('5cb8382d-2c67-41a7-a1b1-cd044c7046c0','face81c1-6eae-401b-88f2-c4c7404cde6e','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Output Formatting (Newlines)','Har test case ke output ke baad ek newline character print karna important hai. Iske bina, saare outputs ek doosre se jud jayenge aur galat formatting dikhegi.','Output ke baad `endl` ya `\\n` mat bhoolna.','medium','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 12:48:45'),('5e9d8ec4-19ee-433a-a961-908c1d6a6124','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','End-to-End Mail Merge Workflow','User now has a clear, structured end-to-end workflow covering adding fresh contacts, preparing the Gmail draft, sending test and actual mails, and post-send discipline for a placement cell context.','Fresh contact add karo, draft prepare karo, test/send mail, phir track karo.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('5f0f2abe-4977-4b3f-b41d-97135af4ec45','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Data Hygiene: Recipient Name Column','The \'Name\' column in the sheet must contain a human name or a professional placeholder like \'Hiring Team\' / \'Talent Acquisition Team\', not a company name. Company name \'OrganizationName\' column mein hona chahiye. Agar \'Name\' blank chhodoge toh unprofessional lagega.','`Name` column mein *person name* ya \'Hiring Team\' likho, company name nahi.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('65824bda-3005-462c-a07c-4456bd02d03b','face81c1-6eae-401b-88f2-c4c7404cde6e','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Competitive Programming Standard Checklist','Competitive programming mein common pitfalls se bachne ke liye kuch basic rules yaad rakhna helpful hai: \'t\' loop, input ko loop ke andar read karna, har test case ke liye sirf ek output, exclusive conditions ke liye \'else if\' ka use, aur har output ke baad newline print karna.','CP checklist: t loop, input inside, one output, else if, newline.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 12:48:45'),('666fd7cc-2c50-4aa2-ac11-1d747e624c1f','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Conflict Resolution Order','Gusse wale student ko pehle calm karna, listen karna, facts verify karna, then team se discuss karna, na ki seedha rules highlight karna.','Pehle calm karo, phir suno, phir rules.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('68aaa9b8-a7ce-4c9f-afb1-64b32878ac0d','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Platform Specificity (Gmail vs. Outlook)','Agar Google Sheets aur Gmail use kar rahe ho, toh Outlook aur Word ka setup follow karna wrong hoga. Google ka apna mail merge process hai. Yaad rahe, Gmail web Outlook ke method se kaam nahi karta.','Gmail/Google Sheets ke liye apna method hai; Outlook/Word ke steps mix mat karo.','medium','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('70fa22ac-ce9e-464a-aba1-f9f7cb5f7718','9df18a3b-7281-4bfa-a6e3-5a336cdc3078','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Two-Pointer Logic for Duplicate Removal (Sorted Arrays)','User ka two-pointer logic `if(arr[l]==arr[i]) { l++; arr[l]=arr[r]; }` mein galti hai. Woh elements tab copy kar rahe hain jab woh *same* hote hain, jabki correct approach mein elements tab copy hote hain jab woh *different* hote hain. `r` pointer ka use bhi incorrect hai, jo `i` se overlap kar raha hai.',NULL,'high','[\"cc25d3a1-37a7-4414-a35e-c45c108ec91d\"]','deferred','2026-02-03 01:27:05'),('78bf0250-243b-4c2b-bd4d-7e207f3f9931','face81c1-6eae-401b-88f2-c4c7404cde6e','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Input Handling (Multiple Test Cases)','Jab multiple test cases hote hain, tab har test case ke liye input variables (jaise \'n\') ko main loop ke andar hi read karna chahiye, na ki loop ke bahar ek baar hi.','Har naye test case ke liye, naya input loop ke andar hi lo.','high','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 12:48:45'),('798b3c7b-3577-47b3-aefc-8cd513d24d1f','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Over-Emphasis','\'Surely, surely, 100%\' jaise words over-emotional lagte hain. Professional tone mein calm aur assertive rehna better hai.','Calm aur assertive, not emotional.','medium','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('80f14f09-d1cf-4bb9-b953-9393170ea4ac','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Perfect Root Problem Approach','Jab ek problem ka statement \'perfect root\' jaisa lagta hai (where `y√=x` implies `x` is a perfect root of `x*x`), toh simple solution aksar sahi hota hai. `1, 2, ..., n` print karna is case mein valid aur sabse easy approach tha.','Simple problem, simple solution. `y√=x` logic clear hai.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('847f2a1b-2519-42b7-b087-a4ca1fd81094','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Mail Merge Tooling Context','Initial understanding was for a generic mail merge process, but the specific user setup (Google Sheets + Gmail) requires a different workflow than Word + Outlook.','Google Sheets + Gmail ka flow alag hai Word + Outlook se.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('8c04d8b1-9f87-4c4e-893d-6cd04e9488d0','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','CC Usage in Mail Merge','Mail merge mein manually `CC` karna avoid karna chahiye kyunki yeh personalization ko kam karta hai. Agar kisi ko copy karna hai toh usko bhi sheet mein `CC Recipients` column mein add karna chahiye taaki merge usko correctly handle kare.','Mail merge mein manual CC use nahi karna, sheet ke `CC Recipients` column mein add karo.','medium','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('8d143ae6-4eed-42bb-8913-ee381ac01894','139ac58b-72a8-47a4-96ad-ac08baa2721c','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Package.json version ranges','User ko samajh aaya ki `package.json` mein use hone wale caret (^) symbols kaise dependency updates ko limit karte hain, aur kyu `npm install @latest` sometimes expected version install nahi karta.',NULL,'high','[]','deferred','2026-02-04 08:02:18'),('94d3cd30-0f1a-4ef3-a803-0a0ca17c3b38','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Google Mail Merge Syntax','Google Sheets-based mail merge mein placeholders ke liye double angle brackets `<<Field>>` use karna zaroori hai, `{{Field}}` nahi. Yeh ek common mistake hai jo merge ko fail kar sakta hai.','Google Sheets ke liye, `<< >>` syntax sahi hai, `{{ }}` wrong hai.','high','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('998da7f6-4046-4cbb-993f-b5e0f9e1bf19','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Conciseness in Closing','Closing statement ko crisp aur focused rakhna chahiye, too long aur exploratory nahi.','Closing pitch ko short aur impactful rakho.','medium','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('9c129da3-c526-4384-abb7-a3e3c630f39a','790c3bec-2600-4646-ba3d-4f1d6638257c','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Algorithm return statement placement','User consistently `return k;` ya `return l+1;` ko loop ke andar daal deta hai, jisse function poora array process karne se pehle hi exit ho jata hai.',NULL,'high','[\"d775603b-3fd7-450b-895a-c8c5bf3a90b0\"]','confirmed','2026-02-03 01:57:18'),('a117cd4f-44a0-4439-aec2-6bfab793b67a','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Recipient Naming in Sheet','Mail merge sheet mein `Name` column mein sirf insaan ka naam ya \'Hiring Team\' jaise general designation likhna chahiye, company name nahi. Agar naam pata nahi toh \'Hiring Team\' ya \'Talent Acquisition Team\' likho, cell ko empty mat chhodo.','`Name` column mein person ya team ka naam, company ka nahi. Empty bilkul nahi chhodna.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('a1c3230b-f77f-4ef2-9aad-b00057c3ad8d','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Empathetic Weakness Control','Empathy aur sabko satisfy karne ki desire ko as a weakness dikhate hue, yeh clarity dena ki policy aur professionalism dominate karenge.','Empathy acchi, but policy pehle.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('a5896a9a-db27-4566-ad45-0f9104275e01','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Mandatory Test Email','Sending a test email to oneself is a crucial, non-negotiable step before sending bulk emails to check for correct field replacement and formatting.','Test mail bhejo, *always*!','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('ac66d680-21de-4cfe-ae4e-8d4b88e9faae','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Pressure Handling Framework','Friends se confidential info requests ko handle karne ke liye ek clear 3-step approach use karna: Refuse politely, policy explain karo, and friend ko official channels pe redirect karo.','Friend request = Refuse, Explain, Redirect.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('bcaf0663-6223-4c3c-8562-771edfdb6abd','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Time Management System','High-pressure roles ke liye sirf motivation nahi, ek clear system chahiye to manage academics aur placement duties.','Pressure? Time management ka system batao.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('c57743bc-a24e-4723-923d-ba8b714b2f25','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','C-style Array Declaration and Input','C++ mein arrays declare karne aur input lene mein baar baar issues aaye. `int arr[];` bina size ke declare karna aur `cin >> arr;` se poora array input lene ki koshish karna galat tareeke the. `cin >> n;` ke pehle `int arr[n];` declare karna bhi ek common mistake thi.','Array declare karne se pehle size pata hona chahiye; `cin >> n; int arr[n];` is the correct flow.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('c6b934a6-9e7a-4fd8-a6c2-a563777d5140','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Avoiding Duplicate Sends & Filtering','Duplicate emails se bachne aur sirf intended recipients ko mail bhejte rehne ke liye, sheet ke `Email Sent` column ko filter karke sirf \'Is empty\' (jinhe mail nahi gaya) rows ko select karna best practice hai. Google Sheets yeh column automatically update karta hai.','Har baar `Email Sent` column ko filter karke sirf \'empty\' rows ko hi mail merge karna hai.','high','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('c72cd7e2-2cbe-4c37-b6a0-b4fd5f18b59a','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Strategic Vision in Closing','Interview mein strategic vision dikhana, like identifying a market gap for startups, generic answers se better impact karta hai.','Vision dikhao, industry gap ki baat karo.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('cc55f835-7265-4bf4-836f-76ab565b1358','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Controlling Mail Merge Recipients','Learned to precisely control which rows receive emails by filtering the sheet. The safest method is to filter for an empty \'Email Sent\' column or use a dedicated \'SendNow\' column.','`Email Sent` column filter karo ya `SendNow` column banao to control recipients.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('d644e2e4-d717-4c7a-b904-9620d4925d52','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Factual Consistency','Closing statement mein \'teen\' bolkar \'chaar\' points highlight karna jaise minor inconsistencies avoid karna chahiye.','Numbers aur facts matching hone chahiye.','low','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('d9c31604-aeef-4b02-a1c7-3e713749458d','b53b93af-2d9b-4b6a-8614-bfa0acb46364','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Placement Cell Mail Merge Best Practices','Recurring advice includes sending emails in small batches (40-70 max), maintaining a gap between batches, avoiding attachments in the first mail, and using professional subject lines with institute details.','Batch mein bhejo (40-70), gap rakho, pehle mail mein attachment avoid karo.','medium','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 12:46:17'),('e04459bb-a2e8-4240-8f23-2427b1302012','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','STL Functions and Complexity','`min`, `max`, `swap` jaise STL functions `O(1)` time complexity ke hote hain, aur `max_element` `O(n)` ka. Yeh competitive programming mein bahut useful aur efficient hain. `algorithm` header include karna zaroori hai.','STL functions `min`, `max`, `swap` are O(1), `max_element` is O(N). Fast and safe hain.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('e3aeba9b-b87e-457d-9d98-5fb3da236452','bd6eaa6b-1c39-4817-8370-0f3d173484a2','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','insight','Post-Send Sheet Management','Ek baar emails bhej dene ke baad, jin rows ko mail ja chuka hai (jinmein `Email Sent` date aa gayi hai), unhe `Email Sent` filter use karke \'lock\' kar dena chahiye. Matlab unhe phir edit ya touch nahi karna chahiye taaki accidental resends na hon.','Sent rows ko lock kar do, unhe dobara mat chhuedo.','medium','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 12:12:13'),('ea4b7b52-a00f-4e87-9cad-40d8f6adf5ea','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Weakness Articulation','Weakness ko defend ya justify karne ki jagah, usse acknowledge karke control mechanism aur policy-adherence show karna important hai.','Weakness? Acknowledge, control, policy.','high','[]','unreviewed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('eadec010-66d5-415a-9ed7-1a506994acb3','769dc162-aac7-4854-aefd-5c35df803b94','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Function return types','User ko C++ mein function ke declare kiye gaye return type ke according value return karna bhool gaye.',NULL,'medium','[\"284ed990-b392-44c1-a9a3-1ff3f533c64e\"]','deferred','2026-02-03 01:31:12'),('ecd1f303-1858-4f9e-895f-dccdef15b1a1','a3f3a4b8-f328-4466-87d1-6479d2c32a19','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','gap','Specificity in Examples','Generic phrases like \'skills and talent\' work nahi karte. Real examples chahiye for communication, coordination, ya leadership.','Claims ko back karo with specific examples.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 07:42:12'),('f3e1351d-8fac-4483-ac31-bc06378ba5bf','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Array Sizing and Variable-Length Arrays (VLAs)','Yeh pattern repeatedly dikha ki user `int arr[n];` ko `n` variable declare hone se pehle use kar rahe the. C++ standard mein VLAs allow nahi hain (though GCC mein chal jaate hain), aur competitive programming mein `cin >> n; int arr[n];` ko common banata hai, but `vector` is safer.','Array size runtime pe declare karna hai, `n` read hone ke baad.','high','[]','confirmed','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('fc3b1a84-a9ef-40f7-9f00-d1e907ed9ae3','ffa3d067-9e7f-4ad6-b307-ace9f02b42c0','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Processing Order in Conditional Problems','Yeh pattern dikha ki user ka tendency tha ki operations ko ek saath apply karke end mein condition check karein, jabki problem mein \'whenever\' (immediate check) ki requirement thi. Isse intermediate state changes ka information loss hota hai.','Condition \'whenever\' ya \'during\' ho toh, har step ke baad check karna zaroori hai.','high','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 08:08:12'),('ff921b72-4fbd-4cf4-b9d5-5fc99020db26','face81c1-6eae-401b-88f2-c4c7404cde6e','74e2ef45-3aaa-4efc-90c9-3ec2bb787ffa','pattern','Conditional Logic (if-else if)','Agar conditions mutually exclusive hain aur sirf ek hi result expected hai, toh independent \'if\' statements ki jagah \'else if\' structure use karna zaroori hai. Independent \'if\' se galat multi-output ho sakta hai.','Ek condition, ek output, toh \'else if\' ka use karo.','high','[]','deferred','2026-02-07 12:48:45');
